{
  "title": "Outstandingly lazy Thai celeriac Curry",
  "description": "A jammy and snappy Thai dish featuring celeriac, perfect for a lazy Sunday, with an ayurvedic-rajasic friendly twist.",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
  "diet": [
